{"id": "bart-sweeping-contract-false-claims", "title": "BART checked the garages the morning after scheduled sweeping", "seconds": 64.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "a59e58575ab9b383", "words": 184, "beats": [{"scene": "s", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "BART’s contract called for trash to be gone by morning. Inspectors went to look.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.38, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "should", "the", "morning", "crew", "find?"], "sub": "BART overnight sweeping"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.82, 1.05, 1.19, 1.54, 1.65, 1.77, 2.02, 2.21, 3.03, 3.61, 3.8, 3.9]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A three-year contract covered station plazas, garages and other BART properties.", "t0": 4.5, "t1": 8.47, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "flow", "context": "Contract terms", "heading": "How each cleaning could be checked", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Scheduled overnight", "value": "Station or garage"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Report due", "value": "Next morning"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.54, 1.03, 1.3, 1.67, 2.33, 2.85, 2.99, 3.2, 3.42]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The contractor said BART first asked for daily reports a year into the contract.", "t0": 8.59, "t1": 12.34, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "October 2024 investigation", "text": "Daily work reports", "mark": "Daily work reports"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.7, 0.93, 1.22, 1.54, 1.75, 1.87, 2.18, 2.61, 2.71, 2.92, 3.1, 3.22]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Inspectors checked the areas after scheduled cleanings and compared them with invoices.", "t0": 12.46, "t1": 16.31, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "25", "label": "Paid charges checked against observations and photographs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.62, 0.87, 1.0, 1.41, 1.66, 2.05, 2.45, 2.57, 2.95, 3.09, 3.25]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "25 charges failed the morning checks. 10 more lacked daily reports.", "t0": 16.53, "t1": 20.49, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Investigation table 1", "heading": "How the charges add up", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "Morning observations", "value": "$4,582.39"}, {"icon": "gap", "label": "Daily reports missing", "value": "$988.70"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 0.98, 1.26, 1.37, 1.66, 2.41, 2.67, 2.93, 3.2, 3.5]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Inspector General substantiated $5,571.09 in paid claims.", "t0": 20.61, "t1": 26.19, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,571.09", "label": "Paid claims substantiated by the Inspector General"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.61, 0.93, 1.74, 2.05, 2.48, 2.75, 3.03, 3.61, 3.95, 4.07, 4.35, 4.7, 4.83, 5.06]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The contractor supplied photographs, and investigators removed two charges from their original count.", "t0": 26.31, "t1": 31.07, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Contractor’s response", "heading": "Two exceptions came off the list", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Photos supplied", "value": "April 29"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Investigation result", "value": "Two removed"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.68, 1.11, 1.87, 2.06, 2.81, 3.12, 3.33, 3.74, 3.9, 4.07, 4.47]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The March records raised a different question. The daily reports listed more cleanings than the bill.", "t0": 31.19, "t1": 36.24, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "March 2024", "heading": "Two records for the same work", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Daily reports", "value": "172 cleanings"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Invoice", "value": "166 cleanings"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.78, 1.04, 1.12, 1.45, 2.41, 2.59, 2.9, 3.39, 3.75, 3.97, 4.42, 4.6, 4.71]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Inspectors flagged possible underbilling. They did not establish an offset.", "t0": 36.36, "t1": 40.38, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,630", "label": "Possible March underbilling identified by the Inspector General"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.61, 0.96, 1.42, 2.4, 2.6, 2.77, 2.97, 3.48, 3.59]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The contractor cited parked cars. The contract required another cleaning method where vehicles blocked access.", "t0": 40.6, "t1": 46.24, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "Contractor response", "text": "Parked vehicles blocked the sweeper", "mark": "Parked vehicles blocked the sweeper"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.74, 1.07, 1.37, 2.21, 2.36, 2.82, 3.25, 3.56, 3.9, 4.19, 4.42, 4.82, 5.16]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "BART tightened oversight. Inspectors saw improved service and dropped the recommendation to end the contract.", "t0": 46.36, "t1": 51.75, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "semi", "kicker": "Inspector General follow-up", "text": "Termination recommendation dropped", "mark": "Termination recommendation dropped"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.6, 1.49, 2.11, 2.31, 2.71, 3.08, 3.21, 3.51, 3.64, 4.38, 4.52, 4.67, 4.79]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Inspector General said BART was seeking $16,713 in restitution.", "t0": 51.87, "t1": 57.08, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,713", "label": "Restitution sought in the FY2025 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.65, 0.99, 1.24, 1.51, 1.65, 2.03, 2.51, 2.95, 3.26, 3.53, 3.98, 4.35, 4.48]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "BART’s counsel later finalized a settlement. The public update gives no amount received.", "t0": 57.2, "t1": 61.74, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "flow", "context": "November 2026 dashboard", "heading": "Where collection stands", "source": "dashboard", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "Counsel’s update", "value": "Settlement finalized"}, {"icon": "gap", "label": "Amount credited", "value": "Amount unspecified"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.69, 0.97, 1.52, 1.6, 2.28, 2.44, 2.81, 3.22, 3.52, 3.69, 4.01]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 61.86, "t1": 63.97, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"s": "The next morning", "r": "What the bills showed", "c": "What BART settled"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "question"}